<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-BHP says Q3 petroleum profits double.</title>
<headline>RTRS-BHP says Q3 petroleum profits double.</headline>
<dateline>MELBOURNE 1997-03-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Broken Hill Pty Co Ltd (BHP) said on Friday that its petroleum division achieved net profits after tax of A$246 million in the third quarter ended February 28, a rise of 103.3 percent on the year-ago period.</p>
</text>
